    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124640/extras/daba2cd084c65e015f3c309963f6b17b.avif?t=1662722278\" /></div><br><br>It's different from other survival games<br>Simple but diverse<br>Various ninja techniques, various situations, various enemies<br>Become a ninja and defeat the enemy<br>20 minutes will feel short<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2>&quot;<strong>Ninja Hagakure</strong>&quot; This is a guidebook for ninjas.<br>Players become a ninja and defeat enemies using 40 different ninja skills used by ninjas.<br>Each stage has to endure various enemies and kings for 20 minutes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2>It's not just a dodge and hold game The controls are simple, but the gameplay isn't simple It's a more focused game by choosing, aiming and using your own ninja skills.<br>There are 40 different ninja skills. Each skill has its own characteristics and you need to use the ninja skill that suits the situation to survive.<br>In &quot;<strong>Ninja Hagakure</strong>&quot;, not only ninja skills, but also enemies have various skills. Quickly select a skill that suits the situation and defeat it.<br>It's a simple game, but it's fun with different situations, different skills, and different enemies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Operation</h2>You have to manipulate, select, aim, and use it yourself, but it's simple<br>Movement - &quot;W,A,S,D&quot;<br>Basic Citation - &quot;Left Mouse Button&quot;<br>Ninja Skills - &quot;Right Click&quot;<br>Knife - &quot;middle mouse button&quot;<br>Reload - &quot;R&quot;",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124640/extras/daba2cd084c65e015f3c309963f6b17b.avif?t=1662722278\" /></div><br><br>It's different from other survival games<br>Simple but diverse<br>Various ninja techniques, various situations, various enemies<br>Become a ninja and defeat the enemy<br>20 minutes will feel short<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2>&quot;<strong>Ninja Hagakure</strong>&quot; This is a guidebook for ninjas.<br>Players become a ninja and defeat enemies using 40 different ninja skills used by ninjas.<br>Each stage has to endure various enemies and kings for 20 minutes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2>It's not just a dodge and hold game The controls are simple, but the gameplay isn't simple It's a more focused game by choosing, aiming and using your own ninja skills.<br>There are 40 different ninja skills. Each skill has its own characteristics and you need to use the ninja skill that suits the situation to survive.<br>In &quot;<strong>Ninja Hagakure</strong>&quot;, not only ninja skills, but also enemies have various skills. Quickly select a skill that suits the situation and defeat it.<br>It's a simple game, but it's fun with different situations, different skills, and different enemies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Operation</h2>You have to manipulate, select, aim, and use it yourself, but it's simple<br>Movement - &quot;W,A,S,D&quot;<br>Basic Citation - &quot;Left Mouse Button&quot;<br>Ninja Skills - &quot;Right Click&quot;<br>Knife - &quot;middle mouse button&quot;<br>Reload - &quot;R&quot;",
